      "content": "It can be incredibly draining to feel like you're a source of stress and worry for those around you. Your loved ones may be trying to support you, but they can't escape the impact of your struggles. Consider reaching out to a therapist or counselor who can help you work through your emotions and develop coping strategies to improve your mental health and well-being. By doing so, you'll be in a better position to share a more positive presence with your partner and kids.",
